Lia-Research — Licensing Status

Copyright (c) 2026 BloomRX. All rights reserved.

This repository is PRIVATE and is an internal knowledge base of the Lia ecosystem.
It is NOT an open-source distribution. This file is NOT a grant of license.

Status of this file
-------------------
The order of service that created this repository (2026-11-17) explicitly forbids
assigning a license to Lia-authored Skills and research material without an
owner decision. Therefore this file deliberately does NOT declare MIT, Apache-2.0
or any other license for Lia content.

Consequences, stated plainly:
- No permission is granted to copy, redistribute, sublicense or publish any
  content of this repository.
- Public visibility of any other BloomRX repository does not imply any license
  for the material consolidated here.
- Research "recommendations" in this repository are not legal advice and are not
  a distribution decision.

Third-party material
--------------------
This repository consolidates research ABOUT third-party projects. When a document
quotes, summarizes or references third-party material, the original license and
copyright remain with the original author. Every research report must record:

- upstream repository URL;
- upstream license identifier as read from the upstream LICENSE file;
- the commit analyzed;
- whether the content was copied, summarized or transformed.

Where third-party license texts are reproduced for compliance purposes, they are
stored under the path named in the corresponding report and are not relicensed by
this file. See governance/LICENSE-AND-PROVENANCE-POLICY.md and
governance/SOURCE-PRESERVATION-POLICY.md.

Lia Skills ("lia-*")
--------------------
The author of the Lia ecosystem states that Lia Skills were created by the owner
or by AI at the owner's request. That statement establishes authorship intent; it
does NOT establish a distribution license. As of 2026-11-17 no license has been
applied to Lia Skills. This is an open decision, tracked in
decisions/PENDING/DR-0001-LIA-SKILLS-LICENSING.md.

Pending owner decision
----------------------
DECISION REQUIRED: choose the license (or the absence of a license) for
Lia-authored content, and for each external capability the ecosystem reproduces or
adapts. Until that decision exists, treat every document here as
"internal use, no redistribution".

Reference: governance/LICENSE-AND-PROVENANCE-POLICY.md
